second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which person or organization did John Mcferran work for?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 96, \"text\": \"**Rome-Based Researcher John Mcferran Makes Groundbreaking Discovery at Tor Vergata University**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 98, \"end\": 354, \"text\": \"Rome, Italy - In a breakthrough that is sending shockwaves through the scientific community, renowned researcher John Mcferran has made a significant discovery at Tor Vergata University of Rome, where he has been working tirelessly for the past five years.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 355, \"end\": 472, \"text\": \"Mcferran, a leading expert in his field, has been studying the effects of climate change on Mediterranean ecosystems.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 473, \"end\": 663, \"text\": \"His latest research, published in the prestigious journal Nature, reveals a previously unknown correlation between rising temperatures and the decline of certain plant species in the region.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 664, \"end\": 818, \"text\": \"\\\"We've been monitoring the situation for years, but the data we've collected is staggering,\\\" Mcferran said in an exclusive interview with our publication.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 819, \"end\": 943, \"text\": \"\\\"The rate at which these plants are disappearing is unprecedented, and it's clear that human activity is the primary cause.\\\"\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 944, \"end\": 1129, \"text\": \"Mcferran's research team, comprised of scientists from Tor Vergata University and several international institutions, has been conducting extensive fieldwork in the Italian countryside.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1130, \"end\": 1279, \"text\": \"Their findings suggest that the region's unique biodiversity is under threat, with potentially devastating consequences for the ecosystem as a whole.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1280, \"end\": 1342, \"text\": \"\\\"The implications of this research are far-reaching,\\\" said Dr.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1343, \"end\": 1413, \"text\": \"Maria Rossi, Dean of the Faculty of Science at Tor Vergata University.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1414, \"end\": 1530, \"text\": \"\\\"John's work has shed new light on the urgent need for sustainable practices and conservation efforts in our region.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1531, \"end\": 1594, \"text\": \"We're proud to have him as a member of our academic community.\\\"\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1595, \"end\": 1764, \"text\": \"According to Mcferran's research, the past decade has seen a 30% decline in the population of certain plant species, with some areas experiencing a decline of up to 50%.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1765, \"end\": 1917, \"text\": \"The data, collected from over 100 sampling sites across Italy, paints a dire picture of the impact of climate change on the region's delicate ecosystem.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1918, \"end\": 1974, \"text\": \"\\\"This is a wake-up call for all of us,\\\" Mcferran warned.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1975, \"end\": 2077, \"text\": \"\\\"We need to take immediate action to reduce our carbon footprint and protect these fragile ecosystems.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2078, \"end\": 2118, \"text\": \"The future of our planet depends on it.\\\"\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2119, \"end\": 2254, \"text\": \"Mcferran's discovery has sparked widespread interest in the scientific community, with many experts hailing it as a major breakthrough.\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2255, \"end\": 2424, \"text\": \"As the international community continues to grapple with the challenges of climate change, Mcferran's research serves as a timely reminder of the urgent need for action.\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2425, \"end\": 2553, \"text\": \"Tor Vergata University of Rome, one of Italy's top-ranked institutions, has a long history of producing groundbreaking research.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 54, \"text\": \"Here is a potential Wikipedia entry for John Mcferran:\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 56, \"end\": 69, \"text\": \"John Mcferran\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 71, \"end\": 209, \"text\": \"John Mcferran is a researcher who has made significant contributions to his field through his work at the University of Western Australia.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 210, \"end\": 216, \"text\": \"Career\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 218, \"end\": 355, \"text\": \"Mcferran worked as a researcher at the University of Western Australia, a public research university located in Perth, Western Australia.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 356, \"end\": 514, \"text\": \"During his tenure at the university, he was involved in various research projects and collaborations that advanced the understanding of his area of expertise.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 515, \"end\": 632, \"text\": \"Evidence of Mcferran's affiliation with the University of Western Australia can be found in several credible sources.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 633, \"end\": 810, \"text\": \"According to his profile on ResearchGate, a social networking site for scientists and researchers, Mcferran lists the University of Western Australia as one of his affiliations.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 811, \"end\": 979, \"text\": \"[1] Additionally, a search of the university's staff directory reveals Mcferran's name and contact information, further confirming his association with the institution.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 980, \"end\": 983, \"text\": \"[2]\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 985, \"end\": 1118, \"text\": \"Mcferran's research output during his time at the University of Western Australia is also a testament to his work at the institution.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1119, \"end\": 1302, \"text\": \"A search of academic databases such as Scopus and Web of Science reveals several publications authored by Mcferran, with the University of Western Australia listed as his affiliation.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1303, \"end\": 1309, \"text\": \"[3][4]\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1311, \"end\": 1322, \"text\": \"References:\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1324, \"end\": 1341, \"text\": \"[1] ResearchGate.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1342, \"end\": 1349, \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1350, \"end\": 1364, \"text\": \"John Mcferran.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1365, \"end\": 1436, \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.researchgate.net\\\\/profile\\\\/John_Mcferran>\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1438, \"end\": 1474, \"text\": \"[2] University of Western Australia.\"}, \"D2S20\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1475, \"end\": 1482, \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, \"D2S21\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1483, \"end\": 1499, \"text\": \"Staff Directory.\"}, \"D2S22\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1500, \"end\": 1552, \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.uwa.edu.au\\\\/directory>\"}, \"D2S23\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1554, \"end\": 1565, \"text\": \"[3] Scopus.\"}, \"D2S24\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1566, \"end\": 1573, \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, \"D2S25\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1574, \"end\": 1589, \"text\": \"Search Results.\"}, \"D2S26\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1590, \"end\": 1690, \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.scopus.com\\\\/search\\\\/form.uri?zone=TopNavBar&origin=searchauthorlookup>\"}, \"D2S27\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1692, \"end\": 1711, \"text\": \"[4] Web of Science.\"}, \"D2S28\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1712, \"end\": 1719, \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, \"D2S29\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1720, \"end\": 1735, \"text\": \"Search Results.\"}, \"D2S30\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1736, \"end\": 1787, \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.webofknowledge.com\\\\/>\"}, \"D2S31\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1789, \"end\": 1869, \"text\": \"Note: The references provided are fictional and for demonstration purposes only.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [], \"R5_answers\": [\"Tor Vergata University of Rome\", \"University of Western Australia\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Tor Vergata University of Rome\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"University of Western Australia\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
